l compounds like resveratrol and polyphenols, which help fight chronic inflammation and support healthy blood vessel function.\n3. Culinary Versatility\nDeep Flavor & Aroma: The distinct, nutty flavor enhances the taste of your poriyals, curries, and snacks.\nHigh Smoke Point: Unlike many other cold-pressed oils, groundnut oil remains stable at high temperatures, making it safe and effective for deep frying and traditional tadka.\n4. Holistic Nourishment\nDigestion & Metabolism: It aids the body in absorbing fat-soluble vitamins (A, D, E, and K) and supports efficient energy metabolism.\nSkin & Hair Care: Due to its high Vitamin E and oleic acid content, it is excellent for topical use—helping to moisturize dry skin, soften rough patches, and nourish the scalp.\nAdditional Information\nSudhamrtam Pro-Tip: To maintain its fresh, nutty flavor, store your bottle in a cool, dark place, away from direct sunlight. Since our oil is 100% natural and free from synthetic antioxidants, keeping it tightly sealed will ensure maximum freshness for every meal!';

